266
00:18:32,460 --> 00:18:34,060
Why have you waited so long?

267
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:35,160
And John Jones,

268
00:18:35,220 --> 00:18:37,240
don't you know that you would not have obeyed him

269
00:18:37,240 --> 00:18:40,280
if he had given a thousand sons upon the cross

270
00:18:40,280 --> 00:18:41,340
because you did not,

271
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:43,080
you would not have obeyed him

272
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:44,400
because you didn't love him enough,

273
00:18:44,460 --> 00:18:45,960
you didn't believe him enough?

274
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:50,280
And as John Jones lay there babbling and crying

275
00:18:50,280 --> 00:18:52,860
and begging for God's help and mercy,

276
00:18:53,660 --> 00:18:57,520
suddenly he felt himself being lifted up into the air.

277
00:18:58,280 --> 00:18:59,900
And he remembered that the Lord had said

278
00:18:59,900 --> 00:19:03,380
that all nations shall be gathered before him

279
00:19:03,380 --> 00:19:05,140
and they shall be judged.

280
00:19:05,460 --> 00:19:06,980
And he remembered that Paul had said

281
00:19:06,980 --> 00:19:09,440
in 2 Corinthians 5 chapter and the 10th verse

282
00:19:09,440 --> 00:19:13,120
that we all shall appear before the judgment seat of Christ

283
00:19:13,120 --> 00:19:16,500
and we shall be judged according to the things

284
00:19:16,500 --> 00:19:17,760
that we have done in our body.

285
00:19:18,260 --> 00:19:20,320
And suddenly from the basement,

286
00:19:20,480 --> 00:19:21,740
the floor just opened up

287
00:19:21,740 --> 00:19:24,720
and the ceiling folded itself away.

288
00:19:25,020 --> 00:19:26,980
And by some unseen help,

289
00:19:27,340 --> 00:19:29,640
the roof was flung from the house

290
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:32,780
and he felt himself going up, up.

291
00:19:33,220 --> 00:19:34,660
And he closed his eyes and said,

292
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:36,280
I will not go, I will not look,

293
00:19:36,360 --> 00:19:37,580
I will not face him.

294
00:19:37,580 --> 00:19:41,040
And then he looked back at the earth at a distance

295
00:19:41,040 --> 00:19:43,760
as the earth exploded.

296
00:19:44,800 --> 00:19:48,320
Her plains, her beautiful rippled hills,

297
00:19:48,460 --> 00:19:50,160
her gorgeous purple mountains,

298
00:19:50,520 --> 00:19:52,960
her oceans, her deserts, her lands,

299
00:19:53,060 --> 00:19:54,460
her houses, her wealth, her beauty,

300
00:19:54,780 --> 00:19:56,520
her riches were all burning up.

301
00:19:57,400 --> 00:19:58,720
And nothing was left.

302
00:19:59,360 --> 00:20:01,660
And John Jones was going to judgment.

303
00:20:02,580 --> 00:20:04,800
And as he approached, he closed his eyes.

304
00:20:04,800 --> 00:20:07,840
But closed eyes could not close out the grandeur

305
00:20:07,840 --> 00:20:09,120
of the beauty that he saw.

306
00:20:09,840 --> 00:20:12,120
For just as John had said in Revelation,

307
00:20:12,300 --> 00:20:14,100
the 20th chapter and the 11th verse,

308
00:20:14,740 --> 00:20:16,360
he saw the dead, the great,

309
00:20:17,500 --> 00:20:20,180
and the 11th verse,

310
00:20:20,260 --> 00:20:22,500
and he saw before him the great white throne

311
00:20:22,500 --> 00:20:24,020
and those,

312
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:26,580
and him that sat there on,

313
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:29,260
