315
00:20:31,640 --> 00:20:33,160
And John Jones saw the dead,

316
00:20:33,260 --> 00:20:34,100
the great and small,

317
00:20:34,240 --> 00:20:36,360
standing before the throne of God.

318
00:20:37,020 --> 00:20:38,020
And John looked,

319
00:20:38,080 --> 00:20:38,820
and there was Mary,

320
00:20:38,940 --> 00:20:39,640
and there was Billy,

321
00:20:39,700 --> 00:20:40,540
and there was Susan.

322
00:20:41,080 --> 00:20:42,480
They were on the right hand,

323
00:20:42,540 --> 00:20:43,740
