347
00:21:34,240 --> 00:21:36,020
Not guilty of murder,

348
00:21:36,140 --> 00:21:37,660
not guilty of adultery,

349
00:21:37,780 --> 00:21:40,940
not guilty of drunkenness,

350
00:21:41,260 --> 00:21:44,600
but he was guilty of neglect,

351
00:21:44,760 --> 00:21:46,720
of the gift that God had given him,

352
00:21:46,860 --> 00:21:47,760
guilty of thievery,

353
00:21:47,760 --> 00:21:50,860
because he had stolen the grace and the goodness

354
00:21:50,860 --> 00:21:52,700
and the blessings of God,

355
00:21:52,800 --> 00:21:54,340
and he had given nothing in return.

356
00:21:54,700 --> 00:21:57,960
He was guilty of turning his back upon the Lord,

357
00:21:58,280 --> 00:22:00,760
of treading his blood-bought covenant under his feet.

358
00:22:01,080 --> 00:22:01,800
John, you're guilty,

359
00:22:01,880 --> 00:22:03,780
and you must pay for all of eternity.

360
00:22:03,780 --> 00:22:10,300
And he felt himself being lifted up and hurled into outer space,

361
00:22:10,360 --> 00:22:12,460
away from the presence of the great white throne,

362
00:22:12,800 --> 00:22:14,100
and him that sat there on,

363
00:22:14,160 --> 00:22:15,280
and he drifted down,

364
00:22:15,520 --> 00:22:16,520
down, down,

365
00:22:17,200 --> 00:22:19,820
