372
00:22:36,300 --> 00:22:37,420
He could see nothing,

373
00:22:37,520 --> 00:22:38,440
he could feel nothing,

374
00:22:38,440 --> 00:22:41,320
except the agony of the terrible loneliness

375
00:22:41,320 --> 00:22:43,560
that he felt thrust into.

376
00:22:43,560 --> 00:22:46,940
And he will remain upon this cursed planet

377
00:22:46,940 --> 00:22:49,960
