378
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:52,180
and to fall for all of eternity

379
00:22:52,180 --> 00:22:55,400
because he went to judgment without his Christ.

380
00:22:58,520 --> 00:23:00,680
Now all of this is just a story.

381
00:23:03,100 --> 00:23:04,680
It never happened.

382
00:23:05,660 --> 00:23:07,600
Thank God it never happened.

383
00:23:08,400 --> 00:23:10,180
But it will happen just as surely

384
00:23:10,180 --> 00:23:12,300
as you're sitting here this morning,

385
00:23:12,300 --> 00:23:14,880
just as surely as you're sitting here today,

386
00:23:15,160 --> 00:23:17,000
unless you're in Jesus Christ,

387
00:23:17,100 --> 00:23:20,680
unless you recognize your obligation to God

388
00:23:20,680 --> 00:23:21,460
while you're living.

389
00:23:22,220 --> 00:23:23,840
Now please listen to me.

390
00:23:24,940 --> 00:23:28,160
Please listen to me this morning.

391
00:23:28,640 --> 00:23:30,820
If you are outside of Jesus Christ's center,

392
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:32,120
listen to me today.

393
00:23:32,520 --> 00:23:33,860
I want you to think.

394
00:23:34,600 --> 00:23:38,080
I want you to think where you are

395
00:23:38,080 --> 00:23:40,360
and what will be your light of this day

396
00:23:40,360 --> 00:23:41,640
