409
00:24:05,660 --> 00:24:06,500
Listen to me.

410
00:24:06,500 --> 00:24:09,640
I didn't say the things that I said this morning to scare you.

411
00:24:10,360 --> 00:24:15,640
I know that I believe that I know my own heart.

412
00:24:16,160 --> 00:24:19,140
And I didn't say the things that I said to scare you.

413
00:24:19,140 --> 00:24:21,360
But if you sit in your seat today

414
00:24:21,360 --> 00:24:23,520
