442
00:25:43,080 --> 00:25:45,760
If you are here and subject to this invitation,

443
00:25:46,000 --> 00:25:47,800
we pray that you will come.

444
00:25:48,360 --> 00:25:50,060
We plead that you will come this morning.

445
00:25:50,160 --> 00:25:51,120
Now, if you're here this morning

446
00:25:51,120 --> 00:25:52,460
