464
00:26:31,540 --> 00:26:33,160
Give me your hand and God your heart.

465
00:26:33,160 --> 00:26:36,800
There's a great day coming,

466
00:26:37,320 --> 00:26:39,300
a great day coming,

467
00:26:39,500 --> 00:26:40,780
there's a great day coming,
